 "_doc": "Walter Sisulu Local Municipality ledger statement (TAX INVOICE / STATEMENT), two layouts: 2025 statements (space-thousands, 'Amount (Inc Vat)' column, charge lines grouped under service headings, kWh bracket truncated so no readings) and the late-2025/2026 layout (masthead sometimes misspelt 'Sisuslu'; comma or space thousands, comma or point decimals; each Elec Cons line followed by a meter table with Date From/To, Reading Type and an Exclusive amount, and the meter number on the next line). Every charge line prints VAT and an incl-VAT amount; ex-VAT = incl - VAT per line. Electricity = Elec Cons KWH (standard, flat) + Elec Cons KVA (demand) + Electricity Basic (other). In one 2025 bill the Basic line's amounts spill onto the next page under 'Brought forward from previous page'; a dedicated fallback pattern reads them. Account = the printed Reference (the bill says to use the account number as reference). Fingerprint: the municipality's own VAT number. Identity: ws_excl_check_r = printed Exclusive (kWh) + printed Exclusive (kVA) + Basic ex-VAT vs total_ex_vat_r: 9/11 within R0.01 (1-cent rounding between incl-VAT and the Exclusive column); the 2 bills in the 2025 layout print no Exclusive column (identity n/a). Checked on 11 bills, 0 contradiction checks. Refuse and interest lines are not read.",
